{"3451670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Quallet 2", "steam_appid": 3451670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of Qualle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quallet 2 is an open world adventure game featuring Nalim, the most-wanted criminal in the whole world of Qualle. There are multiple islands, and multiple countries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you are on an adventure, you can find other people who have a mission for you, but also watch out for the police!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more crimes you commit, the more police there are that follow you. And the more police that follow you, the higher the consequences (a fine or jail time). The amount of crimes you committed change how long you are in jail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each country in Qualle, they speak a different language.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qualle: Qualleish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vingolia: Vingotol</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teyk: Teykian</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nopiosee: Nopiosee</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esperanto Land: Esperanto</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Novatujaquut: Novish</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of Qualle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quallet 2 is an open world adventure game featuring Nalim, the most-wanted criminal in the whole world of Qualle. There are multiple islands, and multiple countries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you are on an adventure, you can find other people who have a mission for you, but also watch out for the police!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Th